{
  "version": "0.9.13",
  "notes": "<!-- dsh-notes:zh -->\n# DSH Studio v0.9.13\n\n## 新增\n\n- 选择框采用统一的自绘下拉菜单，在不牺牲鼠标和键盘操作的前提下，完整呈现当前选项、勾选指示、活动高亮与禁用状态。\n\n## 变更与安全\n\n- 选择器使用 8×5px 箭头、12px 下拉圆角、6px 菜单边距、8×12px 菜单项内边距、14px 菜单文字、18px 选中指示与 590 选中字重，和参考桌面控件一致。\n- 描边输入框改为透明背景及 50% 中性聚焦内描边；选择器单独采用向内 2px 蓝色焦点环。命令面板使用 75% 静止透明度与更柔和的半透明高亮。\n- 单选菜单项提供 `menuitemradio` 与 `aria-checked` 语义；菜单支持方向键、回车、空格和 Esc，并在关闭后将焦点还给触发器。\n\n## 修复与打磨\n\n- Windows NSIS 覆盖安装会先清理应用自有的历史网页资源，防止旧版带内容哈希的文件在升级后残留并阻碍完整卸载。\n- Full 安装器会同时刷新自有离线资源；Lite 更新明确保留已有 Full 离线资源，不触碰配置档案、插件、工作区、会话或凭据。\n- 本版接替未完整跑完的 `v0.9.12` 发布；该版 Windows Full 升级检查发现并阻止了旧资源残留。\n\n## 安装与已知限制\n\n- 可覆盖安装或使用应用内更新。Lite 首次运行需下载依赖；Full 附带离线运行时。\n- 界面继续优先使用 OpenAI Sans 字体栈，但不附带 OpenAI 字体文件；未安装该字体时会使用系统界面字体。\n\n## 验证\n\n- 本地前端构建、lint、275 项前端测试（语句覆盖率 95.1%）、59 项打包脚本测试、Rust 工作区测试、无障碍检查及公开契约检查通过。\n- Lite 与 Full Windows NSIS 安装器均使用各自升级钩子在本机成功编译；浏览器在深浅主题下验证了输入框和下拉选择状态。\n- 发布流水线会在 Linux、Windows 与 macOS 上验证 Lite 和 Full 安装包，并执行 Windows 原位升级和完整卸载；全部通过后才发布校验和与签名更新清单。\n\n<!-- dsh-notes:en -->\n# DSH Studio v0.9.13\n\n## Fixes and polish\n\n- Replace native dropdown popups with the shared menu-backed selector, including checked radio-menu semantics, active keyboard navigation, restored trigger focus, and consistent disabled states.\n- Match the measured desktop controls with 8×5 px chevrons, 12 px dropdown corners, 6 px menu gutters, 8×12 px item padding, 14 px item text, 18 px indicators, and 590 selected-item weight.\n- Keep outline inputs transparent with a neutral 50% inset focus edge, while selectors use the distinct inward 2 px blue focus ring. Command rows now use the reference 75% resting opacity and quieter translucent highlight.\n- Remove owned, content-hashed web assets before Windows NSIS upgrades so old bundles cannot survive an in-place install or block complete uninstall. Full installers refresh their owned offline payload; Lite updates preserve it.\n- Supersede the incomplete `v0.9.12` release run, whose Windows Full upgrade check caught the stale package resources.\n\n## Installation and limitations\n\n- Upgrade in place or use the in-app updater. Full includes offline dependencies; Lite downloads them when needed.\n- The interface keeps the OpenAI Sans-first font stack but does not bundle OpenAI font files; systems without that font use the native UI fallback.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Local frontend build, lint, 275 frontend tests at 95.1% statement coverage, 59 packaging script tests, Rust workspace tests, accessibility checks, and public-contract checks passed.\n- Lite and Full Windows NSIS installers compiled locally with their separate upgrade hooks. Browser checks verified input and dropdown selection states in dark and light themes.\n- The release pipeline validates Lite and Full packages on Linux, Windows, and macOS, including an in-place Windows upgrade and clean uninstall, before publishing checksums and the signed updater manifest.\n\n<!-- dsh-notes:end -->",
